  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Documentation of Indigenous African Musical Traditions in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The preservation and study of indigenous African musical traditions are cultural priorities in post-apartheid South Africa. This project, which involves the documentation of traditional music and its transcription into standard staff notation for preservation and use, directly supports the U.S. embassys efforts to advance shared values and promote respect for cultural diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
